Use AutoEDA runtime files as the campaign source of truth:

- `.autoeda/project_pack/agent.md`
- `.autoeda/project_pack/mission.md`
- `.autoeda/project_pack/repo_guide.md`
- `.autoeda/project_pack/evaluation.yaml`
